    "innovation": "This paper applies iodine-to-calcium ratios in planktonic foraminifera to demonstrate that the upper Southern Ocean was persistently oxygen-depleted during the last two glacial periods, helping to resolve the mechanisms behind the much-debated ice-age atmospheric CO\u2082 decline.",
